== OrgDemo table (bundled sample) ==

Does not use the name Organization. Same columns work for archdioceses, dioceses, and parishes.

<pre>
{{#cargo_declare:_table=OrgDemo
|Name=String
|ParentOrg=Page
|Type=String
|Country=String
|Website=URL
}}
</pre>

